# Ooonana Android/AArch64 cloud package repo seed.
#
# The APK already ships the Ooonana i3 desktop and its core runtime. Keep this
# catalog focused on useful add-on CLI/developer tools. The output remains an
# Ooonana repository consumed only through the Ooonana package manager. Some
# binary payloads are sourced from Alpine 3.23 AArch64 packages during repo
# construction, then indexed and distributed in Ooonana's own repository format.
git
openssh-client-default
openssh-server
tmux
nano
jq
ripgrep
fd
tree
zip
unzip
make
gcc
g++
musl-dev
cmake
ninja-build
nodejs
npm
sqlite
